      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Thread wire through each leg tube before seaming closed. Insert "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "flamingo-safety-eyes"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "safety eyes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " on the head, then stuff. Attach the beak cone below the eye line. Attach the neck tube between head and body. Stuff the body, then insert wired legs at the underside and sew securely. Use "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "flamingo-ladder-stitch"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "ladder stitch"
          },
